// Script Variable VillainMissionContactPopupOnIssue :
"P994167624" "<span align=center><img src=costume:Model_DJZero_Friend width=96 height=96><br></span>Scratch needs your help in the Pocket D nightclub! You can find an entrance in Port Oakes, Sharkhead Isle or St. Martial in Primal Earth, or via Studio 55 in Imperial City in Praetoria."
// Script Variable HeroWidowContactPopupOnIssue :
"P3385395910" "<span align=center><img src=costume:Model_Jessica_Megan_Duncan width=96 height=96><br></span>Jessica Megan Duncan is looking for a hero who can help her out with a secret mission. A mission of love. She can be located in Pocket D, on the main floor near the hero side."
// Script Variable VillainWidowContactPopupOnIssue :
"P2773593067" "<span align=center><img src=costume:Model_Arbiter_Hawk width=96 height=96><br></span>Arbiter Hawk is looking for a villain who can help fulfill a prophecy. A prophecy of eternal love. He can be located in Pocket D, on the main floor near the villain side."
