// Script Variable TitleText :
"P1304619826" "  Special Gift  "
// Script Variable TitleHint :
"P1134557990" "<face heading><font color=gold>Lord Winter</font></face><br><br>Lord Winter is the malevolent incarnation of the dark, cold winter time. He wants nothing more than to extend a permanent blanket of ice and snow over all of the lands. He has corrupted the magic of Father Time to have his Winter Horde surprise unwary holiday celebrants who open the presents that appear around Paragon City and the Rogue Isles<br><br>But in doing this, he has created a vulnerability - if his Winter Lord monsters are defeated, the dispersion of their winter essence can create a special portal to Lord Winter's realm. This portal, which appears in the shape of a big, white present, allows heroes and villains to travel to a parallel realm where winter reigns supreme and confront Lord Winter himself."
